<title>USA: International Forest plans acquisition.</title>
<headline>International Forest plans acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Forest Industries Inc said it will acquire Flour City International Inc, an engineering and construction company for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>It also said it plans a reverse one-for-ten split of its common shares, immediately preceeding the merger.</p>
</text>
